  "comments": "A highly interesting mule<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/60fdad300461a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/60fdad300461a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nInformation about the year of issue 2013 was published at the Central Bank&#039;s website.<br /><br />\r\nMarshal José Félix Estigarribia Insaurralde (February 21, 1888 – September 7, 1940) was a decorated Paraguayan war hero and an elected President of Paraguay for the Liberal party, who following his election, repositioned himself to become dictator. He died in a presumed accidental airplane crash barely a year after his election.<br /><br />\r\nThe Acaray Dam is a hydroelectric dam situated in Hernandarias, Paraguay. It has an electrical output of 210 megawatts (280,000 hp), supplying 3% of Paraguay&#039;s electricity demand.",
